<title>USA: Grease Monkey names Steinbrueck CEO.</title>
<headline>Grease Monkey names Steinbrueck CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER, Colorado 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grease Monkey Holding Co said Thursday it had appointed Charles Steinbrueck as president and chief executive of the company.  </p>
<p>The company said it had also named James Wallace as chairman of the board of directors.</p>
<p>Steinbrueck and Wallace, both of them board members, will replace Rex Utsler, who has resigned from the three positions to become a consultant for the company, it said.</p>
<p>Grease Monkey is a quick-lube organization.</p>
</text>
